# Automated Deployment of Dockerized Portfolio Website on AWS EC2 using GitHub Actions

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates a complete CI/CD pipeline for a Dockerized portfolio website using GitHub Actions, Docker Hub, AWS EC2, and Nginx Reverse Proxy.

Whenever changes are pushed to the GitHub repository, GitHub Actions automatically builds a Docker image, pushes it to Docker Hub, connects to the EC2 instance using SSH, pulls the latest image, and deploys the updated application.

