## 🔄 CI/CD Workflow

```
Developer
     │
     ▼
Git Push
     │
     ▼
GitHub Actions
     │
     ├── Build Docker Image
     ├── Push Image to Docker Hub
     └── SSH into EC2
              │
              ▼
      Pull Latest Docker Image
              │
              ▼
      Restart Docker Container
              │
              ▼
      Nginx Reverse Proxy
              │
              ▼
      Live Portfolio Website
```

