## ☁️ Deployment Steps

1. Developed the portfolio website.
2. Created a Dockerfile.
3. Built the Docker image locally.
4. Pushed the image to Docker Hub.
5. Launched an AWS EC2 Ubuntu instance.
6. Installed Docker and Nginx on EC2.
7. Configured Nginx as a reverse proxy.
8. Generated SSH keys for secure authentication.
9. Added GitHub Secrets.
10. Created a GitHub Actions workflow.
11. Configured automatic deployment after every push.

